<S.WHEELER> I went 6502 -> Z80 -> 8086, and am trying to move on to 68k
<[Kevin] APPERT> you can make kaptan flexible circuits using this technique...
<[Kevin] APPERT> and simulate multilayer with a g-10 base board, soldered 
